A||N||2||turbo86se||back from VA!||||10||
Z||000000||turbo86se||06-19-2000||09:56 AM||||<BR>The Fiero show in Willimsburg was lots of fun, only 17 or 19 Fieros, but it was still lots of fun showing them off.  <BR>Although it was a bone-jarring ride, my 86SE made the trip from SC to VA very enjoyable. The cruise thru Williamsburg was fun, best part was when we were in the tunnel, I put my window down and just listened to the music!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I didn't have the only turbo-charged Fiero!!  A man showed up in a green 86GT with the newer Design One turbo, it also had the wide-body kit.  If you're on here, sorry I forgot your name!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> His was a manual. We spent some time comparing turbos, mine is the MillerWoods unit. <P>Phil's Formula, I mean Coupe  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> was awesome!!  I voted for ya!!  You're 3800SC looked and sounded great!!!  Did you hear Dave and I yelling goodbye yesterday morning?  You left right before Dave and I did. I was really surprised how many Fieros showed up with 3800SC's installed, was it three altogether?  <P>I did walk away with a trophy, even though I took third place.  I knew taht guy with the white 85SE was going to win, he had mirrors under the car, all suspension parts painted...  Curry and I had the only black Fieros there, and we were in a class together, SE modified. Next year Curry said we'd have a black Fiero class  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I thought I lost points b/c the underside of the deck-lid was unfinished from TOM's scoop being glassed on.  TOM, I got many, many complements!!,  oh well, I'll get first next year!!<P>Yesterday, some new friends and I, Dave and his father, from Long Island took the trip from VA until we went seperate ways in DC. I'm now in Maryland visiting family for a few days, and showing off my baby!!  Sometime Wednesday I'll head back down to SC.<P>Motorhead, bhooper, you guys missed out on a great time!!  We need to get something like this going in the fall. Lets set a date soon to meet somewhere and get the ball rolling!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>-- Joel  <P>||||reg||10
Z||000001||Motorhead||06-19-2000||08:07 PM||||Sorry I couldn't be there, sounds like ya'll had a good time!  I hope you took lots of pictures.<BR>Where are you in Maryland?  I used to live on the Patuxant River near Prince Frederick.<BR>You're idea of a get together in the fall sounds good.  My life should be a little quieter by then.<BR>Later,<BR>Mike||||reg||1
Z||000002||zeusrekning||06-19-2000||08:38 PM||||I'm looking foward to a get together also. Also looking foward to getting another fiero. I hope.||||reg||1
